== Effects ==
* Makes farts (e.g. {{I|Butter Bean}}) significantly larger.
** {{dlc|nr+}} Also affects enemy farts.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Having either makes all farts gain knockback. Having both makes all farts gain knockback and inflict confusion.
* {{I|Contagion}}: All enemies killed while infected produce a much larger gas cloud, making the spread much more effective.
* {{i|Isaac's Heart}}: Increases the knockback amount and radius of the heart when fully charged and the heart makes farting noises when it shoots.
* {{I|Jupiter}}: Affects all gas clouds produced, increases them in size drastically.
* {{I|Linger Bean}}: The clouds will be larger, increasing the range drastically. The damage is unaffected.
* {{I|Mucormycosis}}: Spore explosions count as farts, and increase in size.

== Trivia ==
* This trinket originated in ''Antibirth'', where it was originally called [[anti:Giant Bean|Giant Bean]] and had the additional effect of stunning enemies.

